# Testing standards

## Backend (`backend/src/test/`)

| Source dir | Registered by | Naming | Purpose |
|---|---|---|---|
| `java/.../{controller,service,dto,model,util}/` | Surefire (`**/*Test.java`) | `<ClassUnderTest>Test.java` | Unit / component tests |
| `architect/.../ArchitectureTest.java` | extra test-source (`build-helper-maven-plugin`) | — | ArchUnit layering rules |
| `e2e/.../e2e/{PlaywrightE2EIT, MigrationWorkflowIT}.java` | Failsafe (`**/*IT.java`) | `*IT.java` | Browser / workflow integration tests |

Test method naming: `methodUnderTest_condition_expectedResult` (e.g. `resolve_whenClusterVersionForbidden_usesDefaultProfile`, `applyFiles_emptyRequest_returns400`).

**Frameworks in use:**
- `@QuarkusTest` + REST-assured (`given().contentType(...).body(...).when().post(...).then().statusCode(...)`) for controller tests.
- Plain Mockito (`@ExtendWith(MockitoExtension.class)`, `@MockitoSettings(strictness=LENIENT)`) for service-layer unit tests that don't need the Quarkus container.
- `@InjectMock` / `@MockitoConfig(convertScopes=true)` to mock CDI beans (e.g. Fabric8 `KubernetesClient`) inside `@QuarkusTest`.
- H2 in-memory DB for the `%test` profile (`quarkus.datasource.db-kind=h2`, Flyway disabled, `schema-management.strategy=drop-and-create`) — clean up with `@AfterEach @Transactional` + `DELETE FROM ...` via injected `EntityManager`.
- `@TestProfile` for per-test config overrides (see `ExportCorsOriginsOverrideTest`).
- `BeanValidationDtoTest` pattern for asserting `@NotBlank`/`@NotEmpty` contracts: build a `Validator` via `Validation.buildDefaultValidatorFactory()` and assert on `violation.getPropertyPath()`.

**ArchUnit rules enforced today** (`ArchitectureTest.java`, scans `com.redhat.migrationtoolkit.rhcl`, excludes tests) — do not violate these when adding new classes:
- Layering: `controller` → `service` → `client`; nothing may depend on `controller`; only `controller` may depend on `client` indirectly through `service` (`controller` must NOT depend on `client` directly).
- `*Controller` classes must live in `controller..` and have `@Path`.
- `*Service` classes must live in `service..`/`model..`, be `@ApplicationScoped`, and must NOT have `@Path`.
- `*Entity` classes must live in `entity..`, have `@Entity`, and must not depend on `controller..`.
- `client..` types must be interfaces; `*Client` classes live in `client..`.
- `model..`/`util..` must not depend on `controller..`(`model` also not on `service..`).
- No class may use `System.out`/`System.err` or `java.util.logging`.

Run: `cd backend && mvn test` (unit) / `mvn verify` (+ITs, JaCoCo, Checkstyle, PMD) / `./generate-report.sh` (full HTML report).

## Frontend (`frontend/src/`)

- Framework: **Vitest 4** with dual projects in `vitest.config.ts`:
  - `unit-node` — `src/**/*.test.ts` (pure logic, API mocks, locale smoke)
  - `unit-jsdom` — `src/**/*.test.tsx` (RTL component/page orchestration tests)
- Setup: `src/test/setup.ts` imports `@testing-library/jest-dom/vitest`.
- **`@testing-library/react`** + **`user-event`** for component tests; co-locate as `<name>.test.tsx` next to the source file.
- **Mock conventions:** mock `../api/client` and heavy child components (PatternFly forms, dropzones); keep the page orchestrator under test. Mock `react-i18next` with `t: (key) => key`.
- **Coverage today (orchestration RTL):** `ImportPage` (incl. empty package name guards), `ConversionPage` (DNS + API error message), `ConnectionPage` (mount, refresh, error message), `RouteErrorBoundary` (retry + pathname recovery), `AppLayout` (nav/masthead survives route throw), plus smoke tests for `AppStateContext`, `ConversionPolicySettings`, `ClusterVersionsPanel`.
- Utils/API: `vi.mock('axios')` or `vi.mock('../api/client')`; `describe`/`it` + `beforeEach`/`cleanup()`.

Run: `cd frontend && npm test` / `npm run test:coverage` / `npm run typecheck` / `npm run lint`.

### Playwright E2E (`frontend/e2e/`)

- **When:** SDD `/verify` runs `npm run test:e2e` if the change touches `frontend/`.
- **What:** Live 3scale wizard + YAML tab assertions (`yaml-expectations.ts`).
- **Lab env:** `THREESCALE_ADMIN_URL`, `THREESCALE_ACCESS_TOKEN`, `E2E_SKIP_WEBSERVER=true`.
- Run: `npm run test:e2e` / `npm run test:e2e:ui` / `bash scripts/run-e2e-if-configured.sh`.

